From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: adbtrr_work6_pr_fixes_use <>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 12:59:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build/configs: Build the use-after-free detector in
 qemu/build_test

No configuration in the tree enabled CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_UAF, and mm_uaf.c
is only added to CSRCS when it is set. Every call site is behind an
ifdef as well, so nothing in continuous integration compiled a single
line of the feature and a build break in it would have gone unnoticed
indefinitely.

qemu/build_test exists for compile coverage and already runs in the
integration matrix, so enable the option there together with its
defaults. CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_HEAPINFO is already set in that
configuration, which is also the combination where the report carries
the owning task and the allocating address.
---
 build/configs/qemu/build_test/defconfig | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/build/configs/qemu/build_test/defconfig b/build/configs/qemu/build_test/defconfig
index 5ee478dd..22233d1e 100644
--- a/build/configs/qemu/build_test/defconfig
+++ b/build/configs/qemu/build_test/defconfig
@@ -771,6 +771,12 @@ CONFIG_DEBUG_VERBOSE=y
 # CONFIG_ARCH_HAVE_HEAPCHECK is not set
 CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_HEAPINFO=y
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_CHECK_FRAGMENTATION is not set
+# CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_FREEINFO is not set
+CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_UAF=y
+CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_UAF_POISON_SIZE=64
+CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_UAF_DUMP_SIZE=256
+CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_UAF_MAX_REPORTS=0
+# CONFIG_DEBUG_MM_UAF_PANIC is not set
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_IRQ is not set
 
 #
